{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"历代志下","commonName":"历代志下","title":"历代志下","order":14,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"11e64342757a4a6aa21c0c6299496e1b4d142c8a04944b979b3bf57868809712","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":821},"chapter":{"number":27,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["犹大王约坦"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["约坦登基的时候年二十五岁，在耶路撒冷作王十六年，他母亲名叫耶路沙，是撒督的女儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["约坦行耶和华眼中看为正的事，效法他父乌西雅一切所行的，只是不入耶和华的殿。百姓还行邪僻的事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["约坦建立耶和华殿的上门，在俄斐勒城上多有建造，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["又在犹大山地建造城邑，在树林中建筑营寨和高楼。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["约坦与亚扪人的王打仗胜了他们，当年他们进贡银一百他连得，小麦一万歌珥，大麦一万歌珥；第二年、第三年也是这样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["约坦在耶和华—他 神面前行正道，以致日渐强盛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["约坦其余的事和一切争战，并他的行为，都写在以色列和犹大列王记上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他登基的时候年二十五岁，在耶路撒冷作王十六年。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["约坦与他列祖同睡，葬在大卫城里。他儿子亚哈斯接续他作王。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/27.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/28.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2CH/26.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}